## Merge step

<% if (_collaborationMode === 'trunk-solo' && _mergeMode === 'direct') { %>
**trunk-solo + direct:** fast-forward the local branch onto `main` after a green gate:

```bash
git fetch origin main && git rebase origin/main
node scripts/check-all.mjs check
git push origin HEAD:main   # ff-only
```
<% } else { %>
**peer-review / gated-review (or pr-ff):** open a PR and merge once checks pass:

```bash
gh pr create --title "type(#NNN): summary" --body "Fixes #NNN"
gh pr checks --watch
gh pr merge --merge
```
<% } %>

